#* '''1907''', Kemp Plummer Battle, ''History of the University of North Carolina: From its beginning to the death of President Swain, 1789-1868'', Volume 1, [http://books.google.com.au/books?id=vKBGAQAAIAAJ&q=%22fictionary%22&dq=%22fictionary%22&hl=en&sa=X&ei=PJsmU-e7AsbpkAX1_4DoDg&redir_esc=y page 574],
